# Aviator needs NO API key and NO account — this file is entirely optional.
# Copy it to .env only if Google starts serving a consent wall instead of results.

# Consent cookie used to bypass Google's EU "before you continue" page.
# The built-in default works in most cases. To refresh it: accept cookies on
# google.com/travel/flights in a browser, open devtools → Application → Cookies,
# and copy the SOCS value, prefixed as below.
# FLIGHTS_SOCS=SOCS=...

# Optional: point Aviator at a specific config directory instead of the usual
# ./config → ~/.config/aviator → bundled-defaults lookup.
# AVIATOR_CONFIG_DIR=/path/to/your/configs
